    <string name="settings_privacy_summary_body">Puzru uma baahna akoon ama soo galid, mana codsado oggolaanshaha makarafoonka. Ma qabto mana duubo codka makarafoonka, mana duubo mana kaydiyo wada hadalladaada ama nuxurkooda maqal.\n\nPuzru wuxuu isticmaalaa macluumaadka nidaamka maqalka Android ee loogu baahan yahay hagidda maqalka iyo baaritaanka.\n\nMacluumaadka baaritaanka waxaa lagu abuuraa laguna farsameeyaa qalabkaaga, wuxuuna ku jiri karaa xaaladda gudaha ee abka socda. Warbixinnada si toos ah looma kaydiyo loomana diro. Kaydinta warbixin ama ku wareejinteeda ab kale waxay u baahan tahay tallaabo cad oo aad adigu qaaddo.</string>
